SAIRNlegacy role matrix -- 36 resources, 8 roles, criteria 2026-10-14.1

A. completeness -- no resource without a rule, in either direction
  ok       A1. the handler dispatches 36 leg_ resources and the table carries 36 rows
  ok       A2. every resource the handler dispatches has a row, and every row is a resource the handler dispatches -- READ from the source, not a hand-written list
  ok       A3. ROLES_BY_APP.sairnlegacy carries 8 roles and `staff` is STILL among them -- removing it would invalidate every existing credential row
  ok       A4. every row names every role in the vocabulary. A role with no column is denied by decide(), which is right, but silently -- this arm is what makes an omission visible
