  ok       A5. the bands are 9 REGULATED / 15 MONEY / 12 OPERATIONS, as specified. A band count that drifts is a resource that moved band without anyone deciding to move it

B. `staff` is deprecated to the NARROWEST band, not promoted
  ok       B1. THE ARM THAT PROTECTS A LIVE PRACTICE -- `staff` gets NOTHING on any of the 15 MONEY resources, not even read. Mapping the deprecated role to `arranger` would have granted all 15 to everyone who had a login yesterday
  ok       B2. `staff` cannot WRITE any REGULATED resource
  ok       B3. CONTROL -- `staff` keeps read+write on all 12 OPERATIONS resources. Without this arm, "staff is narrowed" is satisfied by a migration that locks every existing employee out of the app entirely

